Judgment: two concurrent same-requestId judgments: both check state, both insert judgment_detail → second hits uk_judgment_head duplicate → catch → replay stored. Partial writes: loser may have updated head_ledger rows (applyJudgment) before failing on insertJudgment. Those would commit — but they're identical values to winner's writes (same params), so state remains consistent. Acceptable.

